Z||000009||tgowens||06-23-2001||12:05 AM||||here is a picture of the one in my gold GT -<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-371f.jpg"> <BR>the color really matches better than it appears in the photo - it is made from a different material than the radio surround and therefore it photographs differently using a flash.<P>There is a piece of double-sided tape on the bottom but I didn't even have to use that - it is a good fit and all I have to do to clean is pick up the tray to remove it.<P>Personally, I don't think it intereferes with too much.....<P>Hope this helps.......<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>                  <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/3GTS_SIG.gif">                   </A>||||reg||1
